---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`연락하기 | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="기술 질문, 피드백, 협업 제안을 위한 연락처" />
		<style>
			main {
				box-sizing: border-box;
				width: 100%;
				max-width: 1120px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem) clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 3rem) clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
			}

			.page-header {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(16rem, 0.75fr);
				gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
				align-items: end;
				padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
			}

			.eyebrow,
			.section-label,
			.contact-index,
			.contact-action {
				font-family: 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
			}

			.eyebrow,
			.section-label {
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				line-height: 1.4;
				letter-spacing: 0.08em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
			}

			.eyebrow {
				margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
				color: var(--accent-primary);
			}

			h1 {
				max-width: 8ch;
				font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
				font-weight: 800;
				line-height: 0.92;
				letter-spacing: -0.065em;
				text-wrap: balance;
			}

			.lede {
				max-width: 34rem;
				margin: 0;
				color: var(--text-secondary);
				font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
				line-height: 1.75;
			}

			.contact-section,
			.details-section {
				padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);
			}

			.section-label {
				margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
				color: var(--text-secondary);
			}

			.contact-list {
				margin: 0;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
			}

			.contact-row {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: 3.5rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
				gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
				align-items: center;
				padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem) 0;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
			}

			.contact-index {
				align-self: start;
				padding-top: 0.25rem;
				color: var(--accent-primary);
				font-size: 0.75rem;
			}

			.contact-copy {
				min-width: 0;
			}

			.contact-copy h2 {
				margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
				font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem);
				line-height: 1.15;
			}

			.contact-copy p {
				max-width: 42rem;
				margin: 0;
				color: var(--text-secondary);
			}

			.contact-action {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.6rem;
				min-height: 44px;
				color: var(--accent-primary);
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.contact-action:hover {
				color: var(--accent-hover);
				text-decoration: underline;
				text-underline-offset: 0.35rem;
			}

			.details-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
				border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
			}

			.detail-block {
				box-sizing: border-box;
				min-width: 0;
				padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
			}

			.detail-block + .detail-block {
				border-left: 1px solid var(--border-color);
			}

			.detail-block h2 {
				margin: 0 0 1rem;
				font-size: 1.25rem;
			}

			.detail-block p,
			.detail-block ul {
				margin: 0;
				color: var(--text-secondary);
			}

			.detail-block ul {
				padding-left: 1.25rem;
			}

			.detail-block li + li {
				margin-top: 0.55rem;
			}

			address {
				font-style: normal;
			}

			@media (max-width: 720px) {
				.page-header,
				.details-grid {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				}

				.page-header {
					gap: 1.5rem;
				}

				h1 {
					font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 16vw, 4.5rem);
				}

				.contact-row {
					grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
				}

				.contact-action {
					grid-column: 2;
					justify-self: start;
				}

				.detail-block + .detail-block {
					border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
					border-left: 0;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main id="main-content">
			<header class="page-header">
				<div>
					<p class="eyebrow">Contact / Seoul</p>
					<h1>좋은 대화를 기다립니다.</h1>
				</div>
				<p class="lede">기술 관련 질문과 글에 대한 피드백, 협업 제안을 환영합니다. 목적에 맞는 채널로 편하게 연락해 주세요.</p>
			</header>

			<section class="contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-channels">
				<h2 id="contact-channels" class="section-label">Contact channels</h2>
				<address class="contact-list">
					<div class="contact-row">
						<span class="contact-index" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
						<div class="contact-copy">
							<h2>LinkedIn</h2>
							<p>기술 토론, 협업, 컨설팅, 강연 제안에 가장 빠르게 답변합니다.</p>
						</div>
						<a class="contact-action" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/parkjeongbin/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
							프로필 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">(새 탭에서 열림)</span>
						</a>
					</div>
					<div class="contact-row">
						<span class="contact-index" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
						<div class="contact-copy">
							<h2>GitHub</h2>
							<p>코드와 오픈소스 프로젝트에 관한 내용은 GitHub에서 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>
						</div>
						<a class="contact-action" href="https://github.com/ppippi-dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
							프로필 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">(새 탭에서 열림)</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</address>
			</section>

			<section class="details-section" aria-labelledby="contact-notes">
				<h2 id="contact-notes" class="section-label">Before you write</h2>
				<div class="details-grid">
					<div class="detail-block">
						<h2>응답 시간</h2>
						<p>일반적으로 2–3일 이내에 답변합니다. 업무 상황에 따라 조금 더 걸릴 수 있습니다.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="detail-block">
						<h2>함께 알려주세요</h2>
						<ul>
							<li>기술 질문: 환경, 오류 메시지, 시도한 방법</li>
							<li>협업 제안: 프로젝트 개요, 역할, 예상 일정</li>
							<li>글 피드백: 포스트 제목 또는 링크</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
